- 只记本次理解与误会处理，继续8阶生活 → p8-leave。条件：{"actor_can_choose": true}

- 用空纸签询问步骤边界，不投料 → p8-M-prepare。条件：{"M_current_supervision_slot": true, "M_dry_only_permission": true}

